{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:6EidKit17PassiveAuthStatusO12notSupportedyA2CmF","title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","roleHeading":"Case","modules":[{"name":"EidKit"}],"symbolKind":"case","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not accessible in the current session context."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notSupported","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On iOS, this occurs because the system NFC stack always pre-selects the national AID1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applet before the SDK receives the tag. The card’s security policy blocks cross-applet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access to the ICAO applet from within an AID1 secure messaging session."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is a platform constraint, not an SDK error. Passive auth works normally on Android."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus":{"title":"PassiveAuthStatus","abstract":[{"text":"Result of passive authentication — verifies that the data on the card was signed by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Romanian state (MAI) and has not been tampered with.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PassiveAuthStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassiveAuthStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus","type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit":{"title":"EidKit","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/eidkit","role":"collection"},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus/notSupported":{"abstract":[{"text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are not accessible in the current session context.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","role":"symbol"}}}